  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strawberry Production and Marketing Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FRAISEN is a pioneering strawberry production company in West Africa created in 2016, its goal is to make dynamic and organize the strawberry sector in Africa, around a common African label. The company aims to support 100 farmers, train 150 young people and partner with 200 groups of at least 500 women each in Senegal.</narrative>
  </description>
